# Loading and empty states

Import from `@webonone/ui-kit`: **`LoadingState`**, **`ListEmptyState`**.

## LoadingState

Centered themed spinner + label for **page, section, route suspense, and session bootstrap** loads.

| Prop | Default | Notes |
|------|---------|-------|
| `label` | `"Loading…"` | Use page-specific copy: `"Loading tags…"`, `"Loading session…"` |
| `size` | `'lg'` | Passed to inner `Spinner` |
| `className` | optional | Wrapper (e.g. `min-h-[40vh] flex-1` on `LazyRoute`) |

**Use when:** list pages fetching data, dashboards, editors, `Suspense` fallbacks, auth callback, platform handoff.

**Do not use when:** inline button loading — keep **`Spinner size="sm"`** inside the button.

Reference: `data/frontend/src/features/tags/pages/TagsPage.tsx`, `LazyRoute.tsx`, `AppLayout.tsx`.

## ListEmptyState

Parameterized empty-list message when **`items.length === 0`** inside or instead of `ItemList`.

| Prop | Required | Notes |
|------|----------|-------|
| `itemType` | yes | Plural noun for default: `"tags"` → `No tags found.` |
| `message` | no | Full override when default template does not fit |
| `className` | no | Extra classes |

**Use when:** collection lists, filtered search with no matches, dashboard activity sections.

**Keep `ItemListEmpty`:** low-level primitive; prefer **`ListEmptyState`** at app/feature level.

Reference: `data/frontend/src/features/tags/components/TagsList.tsx`.

